<description>&lt;p&gt;Coordinated cattle raids in Warrup state killed at least 72 people, and a drone strike on a market in the disputed Abyei region killed at least 73. President Kiir reshuffled the South Sudan Revenue Authority board, reinstating two commissioners after cancelling a previous order, while the Bar Association launched a roadmap to improve access to justice. The government partnered with Israel's Gilat to provide nationwide satellite internet and secured UNESCO world-heritage nomination for the Boma-Bandingilo inscription. Governor Dollar promoted the reintegration of IDPs and returnees, and the U.S. Embassy commemorated staff who died supporting South Sudanese people. Two battle-related deaths were recorded in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiW0FVX3lxTE1YTnRjVTJKTWtONjNzSGEyN0tkdkdzeDhWSmxFMF9aMTRsTFhiUHNoV3VNbGJSbGtxMEoteUN1S2UwckkzVFItRmpFRkFqSGV4bEJjaDdIUjZaYmc?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilgFBVV95cUxOZ2JWa0JmV3VQQUIxM3lFdFJGYWVBbi1nRDVxQ01hTmNISEFjeTF5UXVTYTY4UnFVRUgweHZqX2VlZGUwYlRNZ3l5Z0o2OGZXQVNSYmtpQWZBVXdTS0lIVzFtZ2JKMFBwY0ViM2xvaThOVjRmNURMSE0wdkoyNGY5bjh6UTB3VWplRU50ZmVkbTBqWUxTVGc?oc=5&quot;&gt;Uzalendo News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiggFBVV95cUxNUUZsZUdRNjB2UDFYT0JhcFh3ZHBuLThXTVpjNDRmaEg4WGxaNVRQQ1pwX1pqMUFuZVA3UUMzMTJYZHJwUUJ0N1lUcGdCZVJ2NVhqbVVKR0NaRUdxRnlVaXRjQTRxUWpYd2lwdThnSUpjLXF0MTdlWWQ3T3VvdHBYVXF3?oc=5&quot;&gt;Latest news from Azerbaijan&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiUkFVX3lxTE9vSVBSWjJMX1hFVHZPcmNiOW5uREpxZUJJci1yQVdrWmpOWDBIMVY5aXVNVzR3MV9PRzJqUl9hME5jcHNVVzBZQmhkZGlWcERhTEE?oc=5&quot;&gt;Addis Standard&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Eye Radio&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&qu